"fernsteuerung",[14,1311,1312],{},"SoundNinja kann im lokalen Netz lauschen, damit Bitfocus Companion (oder jeder HTTP\u002FWebSocket-Client) Sounds spielt und stoppt.",[23,1314,1316],{"id":1315},"remote-server-einschalten","Remote-Server einschalten",[94,1318,1319,1325,1331,1337],{},[38,1320,1321,1324],{},[18,1322,1323],{},"Einstellungen → Remote"," öffnen.",[38,1326,1327,1328,484],{},"Remote-Server aktivieren. Standardport ist ",[18,1329,1330],{},"7331",[38,1332,1333,1334,484],{},"Optional: Token setzen. Clients senden ihn als Bearer-Token oder ",[144,1335,1336],{},"?token=",[38,1338,1339,1342,1343,1346],{},[144,1340,1341],{},"http:\u002F\u002FIP:PORT"," kopieren oder die System-IP unter ",[18,1344,1345],{},"Einstellungen → Über"," holen.",[14,1348,1349],{},"Windows kann beim ersten Start eine Firewall-Abfrage zeigen. Zugriff im privaten Netz erlauben.",[23,1351,242],{"id":1352},"bitfocus-companion",[94,1354,1355,1362,1370,1381],{},[38,1356,1357,1361],{},[239,1358,242],{"href":1359,"rel":1360},"https:\u002F\u002Fbitfocus.io\u002Fcompanion",[261]," installieren.",[38,1363,1364,1369],{},[239,1365,1368],{"href":1366,"rel":1367},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002Fcompanion-module-soundninja\u002Freleases\u002Flatest",[261],"SoundNinja-Companion.tgz"," herunterladen. Es gibt noch kein Companion-Store-Paket.",[38,1371,1372,1373,1376,1377,1380],{},"In Companion: ",[18,1374,1375],{},"Modules → Load module package"," und die ",[144,1378,1379],{},".tgz"," wählen.",[38,1382,1383,1384,1387],{},"Eine ",[18,1385,1386],{},"Sound Ninja","-Verbindung anlegen. PC-IP, Port und Token eintragen.",[23,1389,1391],{"id":1390},"aktionen","Aktionen",[35,1393,1394,1400,1406],{},[38,1395,1396,1399],{},[18,1397,1398],{},"Trigger Sound"," — aus dem Live-Dropdown wählen oder 8-stellige Sound-ID tippen (Companion-Variablen gehen)",[38,1401,1402,1405],{},[18,1403,1404],{},"Stop Sound"," — einen spielenden Sound per ID stoppen",[38,1407,1408,1411],{},[18,1409,1410],{},"Stop All"," — alle spielenden Sounds stoppen",[14,1413,1414],{},"Sound-ID in SoundNinja über das Button-Kontextmenü oder den Mehrfachauswahl-Chip kopieren.",[23,1416,1418],{"id":1417},"feedbacks-und-variablen","Feedbacks und Variablen",[35,1420,1421,1427,1439,1445],{},[38,1422,1423,1426],{},[18,1424,1425],{},"Sound Playing"," — wahr, solange diese Sound-ID aktiv ist (für Button-Farbe)",[38,1428,1429,1432,1433,147,1436],{},[144,1430,1431],{},"$(soundninja:connected)"," — ",[144,1434,1435],{},"true",[144,1437,1438],{},"false",[38,1440,1441,1444],{},[144,1442,1443],{},"$(soundninja:playing_count)"," — wie viele Sounds spielen",[38,1446,1447,1450],{},[144,1448,1449],{},"$(soundninja:last_triggered)"," — zuletzt ausgelöste Sound-ID",[23,1452,1454],{"id":1453},"http-api-fortgeschritten","HTTP-API (fortgeschritten)",[14,1456,1457,1458],{},"Basispfad: ",[144,1459,1460],{},"\u002Fapi\u002Fv1",[35,1462,1463,1469,1475,1481,1490,1496,1505],{},[38,1464,1465,1468],{},[144,1466,1467],{},"GET \u002Finfo"," — App-Name, Version, Protokoll, ob ein Token nötig ist",[38,1470,1471,1474],{},[144,1472,1473],{},"GET \u002Fsounds"," — Soundliste (id, name, tabs, active)",[38,1476,1477,1480],{},[144,1478,1479],{},"GET \u002Fstate"," — Sounds plus gerade spielende IDs",[38,1482,1483,621,1486,1489],{},[144,1484,1485],{},"POST \u002Ftrigger",[144,1487,1488],{},"{ \"id\" }"," — Sound abspielen",[38,1491,1492,1495],{},[144,1493,1494],{},"GET \u002Ftrigger\u002F:id"," — abspielen (einfach im Browser testen)",[38,1497,1498,1501,1502,1504],{},[144,1499,1500],{},"POST \u002Fstop"," mit optionalem ",[144,1503,1488],{}," — einen Sound oder alle stoppen",[38,1506,1507,1510],{},[144,1508,1509],{},"GET \u002Fws"," — Live-Status; Trigger\u002FStop eingehend senden",{"title":153,"searchDepth":154,"depth":154,"links":1512},[1513,1514,1515,1516,1517],{"id":1315,"depth":154,"text":1316},{"id":1352,"depth":154,"text":242},{"id":1390,"depth":154,"text":1391},{"id":1417,"depth":154,"text":1418},{"id":1453,"depth":154,"te